category: Libs
build-depends: cygport bison flex libfoma-devel libfst-devel libicu-devel libreadline-devel python3-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Helsinki Finite-State Technology (library and application suite) (utilities)"
ldesc: "This package contains a bridging library for multiple FST libraries and
toolkits and set of tools for processing of finite-state automate especially
for linguistic systems."
